      "message": "Broadly, I like this, but I see some significant issues, for which I\u0027ve suggested some alternatives:\n\n1. This patchset complicates the interface between the DPM and the alt mode modules in ways that seem unnecessary.\n\n2. I don\u0027t think this patchset will handle the case where the DPM requests exit mode during mode entry.\n\n3. This patchset doesn\u0027t leave the alt mode machines in INACTIVE state after finishing the exit mode process.",
